    },
    {
      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "DigiRL uses an <strong>advantage-weighted regression (AWR)</strong> algorithm to fine-tune the VLM. It incorporates a <strong>doubly-robust estimator</strong> to handle stochasticity and a <strong>automatic curriculum</strong> to prioritize tasks based on their difficulty and the agent's proficiency. The approach also utilizes a <strong>scalable and parallelizable Android learning environment</strong> to support online RL.",
