    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "DigiRL achieves state-of-the-art performance on Android device-control tasks, outperforming prior methods by a significant margin. The approach demonstrates a <strong>49.5% absolute improvement</strong> over supervised fine-tuning with static human demonstration data. The results also show that DigiRL can recover from mistakes more efficiently than other methods.",
